2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	CMake skeleton and an empty module that reports the ONNX Runtime
	version.

	* CMakeLists.txt:
	New. Includes the shared cmake layer, calls quickjs_module_options()
	once and builds module ort (ort.so) linked against ONNX Runtime.

	* cmake/FindQuickJS.cmake, cmake/BuildQuickJS.cmake,
	cmake/QuickJSModule.cmake:
	Synced from the quickjs-native-bindings skill (cmake-sync.sh).

	* cmake/UseMultiArch.cmake, cmake/Functions.cmake, cmake/Compat.cmake:
	Copied from qjs-nanovg (no canonical copy yet).

	* cmake/FindONNXRuntime.cmake (find_onnxruntime):
	New. ORT_PREFIX, pkg-config, find_path/find_library and the vendored
	third_party/onnxruntime-* copy.

	* tools/fetch-onnxruntime.sh:
	New. Unpacks the NuGet package of ONNX Runtime into third_party/ and
	adds the libonnxruntime.so.1 SONAME link the package lacks.

	* quickjs-ort.c (js_init_module):
	New. Exports version from OrtGetApiBase()->GetVersionString().

	* .gitignore:
	Ignore third_party/.

