	New. Rough API page: module exports, Tensor and Session (PoC entries
	marked), errors, threads, the u2netp example.

	* TODO.md:
	Each PoC task is now a "###" section with the exact implementation
	steps (shared state, native structs, constructor steps, error paths,
	ownership of views, verification), plus a "How to work on the tasks"
	section with the facts checked against the headers and QuickJS
	sources (no installed qjs-modules utils.h, JS_NewArrayBuffer does not
	call its free function on failure, status handling of the ORT API).

2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	Helper pair js-utils.[ch], adopted from qjs-sound and qjs-nanovg.

	* js-utils.h, js-utils.c:
	New. js_class_register, js_object_from_target, js_typedarray_kind
	(exact kind by class id), js_typedarray_get and js_typedarray_expect
	(bytes without copy), js_typedarray_external (view over native
	memory, free callback runs exactly once), js_typedarray_copy,
	js_array_toint64, js_array_length, js_global_get_str. Element kinds
	are the JSTypedArrayEnum of quickjs.h. Self-tested under ASan and
	UBSan: kinds, offsets, zero length, bad dims, external memory
	lifetime, subclass prototypes.

	* CMakeLists.txt:
	Build js-utils.c into module ort.

	* TODO.md:
	The tasks use the helpers instead of hand-rolled code. QuickJS facts
	found by the self-test: JS_NewTypedArray with one argument gives a
	length 0 array for an ArrayBuffer, JS_GetTypedArrayBuffer rejects a
	DataView.

2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	C style rules recorded.

	* CLAUDE.md (C style):
	New section, written as general rules without code examples. All
	variables are declared at the beginning of their block scope, an
	assignment used only for a test is folded into the test, and an
	empty line follows the closing brace of an inner block.

2026-11-24  Roman Senn  <roman.l.senn@gmail.com>

	Tensor class, float32 only (PoC task 1), written by the nemotron
	harness session and reviewed.

	* quickjs-ort.c (js_ort_init_api, js_ort_throw_status,
	js_ort_tensor_ctor, js_ort_tensor_finalizer, js_ort_tensor_gc_mark,
	js_ort_tensor_get_type, js_ort_tensor_get_dims,
	js_ort_tensor_get_data, js_ort_tensor_wrap, js_ort_init):
	New. Tensor(type, data, dims) over a Float32Array without copying,
	getters type, dims and data, Symbol.toStringTag, subclassable. ORT
	errors become Error objects with the ORT message and a code. The
	data getter of an output tensor is still undefined (task 3).

	* tests/tensor-test.js:
	New. Constructor, getters, bad type, bad dims, zero dims, subclass,
	scalar.

	* TODO.md:
	Task 1 deleted.
